------------
REWEIGHTING
------------
Calculates weights considering both the Metadynamics bias and the walls bias by including the --walls flag.

## REQUIRED FILES:
Link the following file in the directory:

	- colvar file from step 1

## REWEIGHTING

module load python

python append_weights.py -f colvar --walls

##OUTPUT

A new colvar file with two additional columns:

	- weight --> calculated using only the primary bias (pb.bias)
	- weight_walls --> calculated using the sum of the primary bias and walls.bias if --walls option is specified.


This script was developed following the PLUMED MASTERCLASS
https://www.plumed.org/doc-v2.7/user-doc/html/masterclass-21-1.html
